<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81035" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιᾰγωγ-ή</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιᾰγωγ-γά</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>turning
			round</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄνου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Fract.</u>
					31
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιαγωγαὶ τῆς ἐπιδέσιος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Art.</u>
					62
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χειρῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					6.92
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				518d
			</span></i>; <i>whirling</i> of a sling, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				27.11.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> metaph.,
				<i>distraction</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.588d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>carrying round</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τον͂ ὕδατος εἰς τὸ βαλανεῖον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					42(1).109i
				</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				ii44
			</span></i> (Epid., <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἐπιτηδείων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Nic.</u>
					7
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>rotalion, revolution</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρέφεσθαι
				διττὰς καὶ ἐναντίας π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				270a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ οὐρανοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mu.</u>
					399a2
				</span></i>
			; of the moon, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.923c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. περὶ τὸν ἄξονα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hierocl.
					<u>in CA</u>
					24p.474M.
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ὀρχηστικῆς περιαγωγαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Salt.</u>
					71
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τῆς ψυχῆς π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				2.1.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in Tactics,
				<i>wheeling</i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				3.5.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>Tact.</u>
				18.4
			</span></i> (both pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>circuit</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καμπὴ καὶ π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.819a
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				407c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>circumference</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀστέων,
			λοβῶν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SD</u>
				1.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				13
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<i>enclosure</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. φυτώδης</span>, of
			a grass-<i>plot</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Erot.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκχλοιούμενα</span>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>6.</b> Rhet.,
				<i>rounding</i> of a period, <i><span class="en">
				Demetr.
				<u>Eloc.</u>
				19
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ περιαγωγῆς συντεθεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anon.
					<u>Fig.</u>
					p.114S.
				</span></i>
			</div>
